00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:34,080
So the way the free tier worked is that we have the record.

278
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:38,960
and so when you want to go to court, then you buy a copy of the record from us.

279
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:45,200
We will either give you a digital copy or you can download it as a PDF, which a lot of courts won't take.

280
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:47,760
And then the other option is to do a printed copy.

281
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:52,160
So we would actually print them out, buy them, do an affidavit and then send them to them.

282
00:21:52,640 --> 00:22:05,360
When we went to the 999 tier from the 499 tier, we basically structured it so that you got a deeper discount on printed records because printed records cost us a significant amount of labor and effort to go and do it.

