00:22:47,280 --> 00:22:52,800
So video calling is expensive for us because, you know, you have to store that video and you have to store that audio.

296
00:22:53,520 --> 00:23:02,400
So we made it so that they got a bundle of minutes and a bundle of time that made really sense and then we could take it up each level as we went forward.

297
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:03,920
So that was the primary.

298
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,720
Again, it was like adding and creating value, right?

