00:25:38,960 --> 00:26:00,880
Talking Parents' business is not going to apply to your specific business, but you should be looking for these opportunities to layer on deeper and deeper value because there is still so much opportunity to increase the value you're delivering and then actually charge for it because 25 dollars a month for a consumer subscription app, but you're delivering that kind of value.

