00:45:41,680 --> 00:45:47,840
We have to do that to stay in business, but we also believe that our app is delivering value that makes people's lives better.

561
00:45:48,320 --> 00:45:51,840
Yeah, and ultimately, you know, helping kids, right, in a potentially tough situation.

